{"server":"tw","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_01_end","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_01","title":"花格窗邊的夢想","storyCode":"SS-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"1905abd7ca51ce2976977b1a77c00f40dd2d3a7df2858fcce6d9fff0d3daa747","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"除了祥子，Ave{@nbs}Mujica的成員們都深陷於夢境中。祥子與夢城堡的“主人”莫菲絲達成賭約，前往每個成員的夢境中嘗試喚醒她們。然而，祥子一進入若麥的夢境，就被若麥鋪天蓋地的廣告所震驚。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>童話書裡說，在維多利亞的某處矗立著一座只有孩子才能看見的城堡。</i>\n<i>城堡裡住著幾位善良的仙女，她們會定期舉辦宴會招待孩子們，並用美夢一一實現他們的願望。</i>\n<i>但如果想細問“夢城堡”到底是什麼模樣，卻沒有一個孩子能回答得出來。</i>\n<i>精心創造的美夢，從孩子們離開夢境的那一刻起，就在不斷地被淡忘。</i>\n<i>美夢不斷被塑造，然後又不斷被遺忘。</i>\n<i>重複塑造，重複遺忘。</i>\n<i>這一切對於善良而忙碌的仙女們來說，是不是有點不太公平？</i>\n<i>“是的，莫菲絲。”</i>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎來到夢城堡，我是這裡的現任主人，莫菲絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夢城堡……的主人……不對，你做了什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你夢裡演的一樣啊？只不過是讓你們做了一個夢罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉——不過你的夢實在太無趣了，都是一些無聊的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）還有那兩個……討厭的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認識愛麗絲……還有貝娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們不是夢裡的角色，是真實存在的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒希望她們只存在於夢裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以不要一直提那兩個傢伙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在和我說話欸！現在我才是這裡的主人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點讓我離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近都沒什麼孩子來夢城堡了，我怎麼可能隨便放你走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡爾頓們又不能說話，沃爾夫只有一個，而且現在話都說不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡爾頓們","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（失落的哼唧聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是因為自己太無聊了，所以才把我關在這個城堡裡的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要說得好像我來者不拒一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的經歷都很有趣——記憶裡的那些經歷還有那些陌生的場景，我反覆研究了很多遍呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你偷看了我的記憶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個傢伙沒有和你說過嗎？瞭解孩子們的過去，也是塑造夢境很重要的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你確實是個例外……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明經歷了那麼多無法忘卻的事情，頭腦卻還是一如既往地清醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了彌補這個小小的遺憾，我願意為你重新塑造一個美夢。正好我們現在面對面，你可以跟我說一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉溺在夢境和過往的痛苦中，都是懦弱的表現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你還真是嘴硬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果按照你說的，無法面對現實的人全都是懦夫的話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這樣的人，真的很多呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i02_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"帷幕漸漸拉開，座椅從台下緩緩升起。\n而座椅上坐著的，是祥子再熟悉不過的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"初華……睦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祐天寺……還有八幡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……大家怎麼都睡著了？"},{"type":"narration","text":"周圍的一切猶如舞台布景。\n沉睡的少女們，就是巨大布景中安眠的人偶。\n無聲，無息。\n祥子一遍遍地嘗試喚醒自己的同伴，卻仍無濟於事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別白費力氣了，沒用的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i02_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我對自己的能力還是很有信心的。她們正沉浸在自己的美夢裡，你叫不醒她們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在我為你們創造的夢境裡有什麼不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的朋友們都相信你，這樣不好嗎？沒有任何你不想看到的別離，你也不用隱藏自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看看她們，難道你要說她們都是懦夫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然我有辦法從你的夢中醒來，她們也一定可以……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"突然間，祥子感到幾股巨大的力量拉住自己，等她反應過來時，她的四肢已經被絲線牢牢綑綁。\n無法控制身體的緊張感瞬間侵占了她的思維，她努力地想讓自己保持冷靜。\n然而，緊繃的絲線將她身上一切微弱的抖動毫無保留地放大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這個嘴硬的傢伙，就不能承認夢境是美好的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子努力想辦法讓自己的呼吸變得平順。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你……似乎對自己的能力很有自信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許在我來到這裡之前，從來沒有人打破過你的夢境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然！我本來就是這個城堡裡最擅長造夢的仙女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的甦醒只不過是一個意外，再來一次肯定就沒問題了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子清楚地看到，莫菲絲說出最後那幾個字時，明明是咬牙切齒的表情，但轉眼間又變得無比天真燦爛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……豐川祥子，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然你這麼有自信，那我就跟你打個賭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……打賭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！絕對公平的打賭喔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的對手越是露出孩童般的微笑，就越顯得無比危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，很簡單！"},{"type":"narration","text":"雖然那孩子繞著舞台轉著圈，但祥子很清楚她肯定一直在盯著自己。並且，黑暗中還有無數雙眼睛也在緊盯著自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會邀請你進入她們每一個人的夢境，讓你有機會喚醒她們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你可以認識她們、瞭解她們，看看她們到底在夢境中過著怎樣的生活。如果你能讓她們像你一樣醒來，我就讓你們離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你失敗了，那她們就要永遠留在夢境裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我會把她們都叫醒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ave{@nbs}Mujica少了任何一個人，我都不會離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她們每個人都是我挑選出來的、最好的成員。我不會讓她們任何一個人受你的擺布。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那就不一定囉。如果你失敗了，你也要重新進入我為你創造的夢境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這次你一定不會再醒過來的。我會讓你忘記以前的一切痛苦，自願活在裡面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣？還是說，你想收回之前說的那些話了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算我現在拒絕，你也不可能放我走吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈！你很聰明嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"豐川祥子，我很期待你在她們的夢境裡，露出絕望又無助的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會向你證明——你逃不掉的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫菲絲手指輕動，祥子的視線頓時變得模糊不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g8_interviewstage"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i04"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i07_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"五顏六色、變異扭曲的光影湧入祥子的腦海中。\n舞台下喧鬧歡呼的人群。\n雨夜中的一抹黑影。\n坐在椅子上的孤獨少女。\n還有無數個無法分清的人影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"享受我為你們創造的美夢吧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"川流不息的車陣、高聳入雲的建築還有無處不在的霓虹招牌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從夢境裡出來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賣力的商販","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛出鍋的新鮮鱗丸哦——快來看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的行人","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點快點，後面還有很多人在等！活動快開始了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹練的快遞員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你好！包裹到囉——人不在家？請問我可以放在門口嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現代的建築、動物的耳朵……這裡到底是哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"名為“鱗丸”的小吃包裝上，印著“龍門傳統手工製作”。\n行人搭乘的交通工具塗著碩大的“龍門交通”標誌，從眼前疾馳而過。\n幹練的先生衣服上的公司名稱，同樣以“龍門”開頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門……這裡到底是誰的夢境？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個熟悉的聲音從祥子的頭頂上傳來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們好喵呣喵呣~~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g8_interviewstage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"粉絲朋友們大家好，我是新人演員若麥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最新主演的電影《少女鼓手》已經上映囉，希望大家都可以去電影院支持一下若麥~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g8_interviewstage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林群眾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凌晨三點！徹夜難眠！超想吃鱗丸怎麼辦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然是吃“喵速達”鱗丸啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“喵速達”鱗丸，若麥和雲獸都喜歡吃的鱗丸！等你來買哦~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g8_interviewstage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十分鐘化好一套妝完全沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“夢繪人”系列輕巧組，用最簡單的步驟化出一百分的妝容！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我一起，成為最想成為的自己吧~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g8_interviewstage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若麥也愛你們喲~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼夢裡面全都是她的廣告……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的粉絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我要瘋了啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的粉絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"若麥她……實在是太可愛了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的粉絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"每個表情、每個動作、每句話，都在撩撥我的心弦啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心動的粉絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"真的、真的能變得和若麥一樣漂亮嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心動的粉絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"——我也想入手她的同款！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡擠得水洩不通，該不會都是來看她的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的粉絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然……若麥，就和自己的女兒一樣可愛啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的粉絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵呵呵呵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的粉絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳咳咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您沒事吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的粉絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"若麥，若麥！我看到她了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心動的粉絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"在哪裡？在哪裡？借過一下，讓我過去！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，等等！請不要推擠……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祐天寺——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g10_dreamcastlestage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈……沒想到一開始就這麼狼狽啊，實在是太有趣了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡爾頓們","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（歡快的哼唧聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為、為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒必要……她、她，贏、贏不了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話都講不清楚，你就沒必要想這種問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在她進入夢境的這段時間裡……我一定能找到失誤的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是這座城堡裡最有天賦的造夢師。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫菲絲盯著正在沉睡的少女，不再言語。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
